  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "From $L=\\frac{\\mu_{0} N^{2} A}{1} \\alpha \\frac{N^{2}}{1}$\nwe get, $\\frac{\\mathrm{L}_{1}}{\\mathrm{~L}_{2}}=\\frac{(1 / 2)^{2}}{1 / 2}=\\frac{1}{2}$"
